.TH "PB-EDGE" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-edge - Inspect tunnel edges


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb edge [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect tunnel edges

.PP
List edges in the active workspace according to its tunnel pool. Managed-only lists Paperboat-managed edges; self-hosted-only lists only the selected self-hosted edges and never falls back to managed edges. Self-hosted browser publications require a verified customer domain and ready certificate.

.PP
With --json, this command group lists its available commands.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for edge


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP, \fBpb-edge-list(1)\fP
